{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026SG6iPntW9f1793445987.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在萬聖夜前夕，中環蘭桂坊傍晚起已經人頭湧湧，有酒吧預計，今晚會創開業以來最高營業額。</p><p></p><p>未入夜，一班「嘩鬼」，已經在中環蘭桂坊出沒，天使與魔鬼雙雙出動，竟然是爭著和他合照。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.LKF 1830..jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026RQEeP9iJzu1793446161.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.LKF 1830._001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026cdCUJNleGn1793446033.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>精心的布置，吸引不少人爭相舉機打卡，亦有旅客專門來感受氣氛。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.LKF 1830._002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026sieri24Aq71793446073.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>內蒙古旅客李小姐稱：「我是黑化的包租婆，這裡的氛圍非常非常好，所以我好想好想體驗一下，所以就做了妝造。」</p><p></p><p>Ayden表示：「我看了一套電影，有個魔鬼都是這樣打扮，所以我扮演魔鬼，很開心，因為我看到很多身穿不同衣服的人。」</p><p></p><p>受惠旅發局今年首度舉辦萬聖月活動，有酒吧表示本月生意額整體上升約三成。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.LKF 1830._003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Ha2CXieaES1793446141.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>酒吧負責人Adrian說：「因為旅發局活動，帶動人流來港過萬聖節，而不只是集中於30、31日，旅客提早上周已經進入萬聖周，人流最後都是會回到蘭桂坊，最後終點站都是中環，因為這裡是可以玩到最晚的地方，昨天是差不多開店以來最高的生意額，我們預計今天的生意額會再創新高。」</p><p></p><p>他又稱今晚會延長營業至凌晨五時，估計可以做三至四輪生意。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.LKF 1830._005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026NwRgm85Af91793446118.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:37.182917+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":426,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T11:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.797689+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:26.674499+00:00","content_hash":"85d790df384b2932c6f368fc8b3b6105e86770ded793ad5c35ca82887454bd0e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:37.182917+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}